lps_LWR2 = MAX(HCap_LWR2,CCap_LWR2)/(1.007*11)/1.2*1000/3600 ! Supply air flow rate for LOWER2 per ASHRAE 90.1-2007 G3.1.2.8. lps_LWR2 [L/s]
